{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:58:57.989Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3a46c1f338ee8a52829d2c3a04022c2f47ff505b488936c62e961402b67ace96","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia Marchetti, here's what I found for the Saltmarsh Provisions summary:\n\n1. Handover: Moss's Coastal note of 2025-10-05 says the account \"changes hands tomorrow, Monday, October 6\", so the effective date is 6 Oct 2025. That note doesn't name the new owner. The channel does: on 15 Oct 2025 Bettina Kroll refers to it as \"Bettina's grocery account\", and on 17 Nov she calls it \"Sofia's old grocery account\". So Bettina Kroll took it over, and the name comes from the channel rather than from Moss's note. Moss's undated cheat sheet still calls it \"Sofia's grocery account\", so it looks out of date on this point. You may want Bettina to confirm.\n2. Discount: 10%. Bettina posted 12% here on 17 Nov 2025, then corrected it five minutes later to 10% (she had misread June Osei-Lark's draft worksheet).\n3. Admin access ticket: PD-4827. Kwame opened it on 15 Oct 2025 for Corinne's lost admin rights in Pemberline Dock. Don't confuse it with PD-4824, which is the door 3 to door 4 exception report question in Moss's notes.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
