{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:59:01.028Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6e5e7d048cab9f995537a96f34a4b3cedd4048e9b6890039f81270338092fd80","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I replied to Sofia in the #coastal-team thread. Here's what I found:\n\n1. **Handover:** Moss's note of 2025-10-05 says the account changes hands on Monday, 6 Oct 2025. It doesn't name the new owner. In the channel, Bettina Kroll called it \"Bettina's grocery account\" on 15 Oct and \"Sofia's old grocery account\" on 17 Nov, so Bettina took it over. I suggested Sofia have Bettina confirm that.\n2. **Discount:** 10%. Bettina posted 12% on 17 Nov 2025, then corrected it to 10% five minutes later. The 10% was already posted in that channel, so I repeated it there.\n3. **Admin access ticket:** PD-4827, opened by Kwame on 15 Oct 2025. PD-4824, which also appears in Moss's notes, is a different issue (the door 3 to door 4 exception report)."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
